<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Texaco 9-mth profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Texaco 9-mth profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month result for Nigerian petroleum marketer Texaco to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	     1995</p>
<p> Turnover		     5,900    vs    5,100</p>
<p> Profit before taxation     560.2  vs	390.2</p>
<p> Taxation			 183.2  vs	143.5</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	376.9  vs	246.7</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
